| |   Date:     06/03/11 18:52:47
| |   Branch:   uk.co.unchartedbackwaters.encspot
| |   
| |   Changelog: 
| |   
| |   Improve/simplify readBits implementation.
| |   
| |   EncSpot spends the majority of its time in readBits. readBits now only
| |   fills the buffer if the request cannot be satisfied otherwise. The
| |   buffer is now a long, which means that on some platforms, more bytes
| |   will be read during a single buffer refill.
o |   ----------------------------------------------------------------------
| |   Revision: d8bdee8b9eb086f488d0fee3b7d5d5c6310cbdda
| |   Parent:   54342ad80a9353bb143df82e7b62a7cff4a4fe93
| |   Author:   Francis Russell <francis@unchartedbackwaters.co.uk>
| |   Date:     06/03/11 15:52:11
| |   Branch:   uk.co.unchartedbackwaters.encspot
| |   
| |   Changelog: 
| |   
| |   Fix compilation warnings under Lucid.
| |   
| |   The Lucid PPA build complains about the unused return values from fread.
| |   Use them to fail quickly on read errors and unexpected EOFs, and to
| |   place better bounds when searching buffers.
| |   
| |   This commit may also fix skipping over an ID3 tag with an extended
| |   header, but I have yet to find an MP3 file that has an ID3 tag with one.
